rue}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/328212fe1b2bd30aefb84621093f654e.jpg?v=1752150841"},{"product_id":"the-edge-chronicles-the-descenders","title":"The Edge Chronicles: The Descenders","description":"\u003cp\u003eCade Quarter has spent the last few years of his life running from an enemy he’s never even met – the ruthless and power-hungry High Professor of Flight, Quove Lentis. But Quove’s deadly agenda has finally caught up with Cade, and now he must leave his home and flee once more, this time to the legendary floating city of New Sanctaphrax. But even reuniting with his uncle, Nate Quarter, isn’t the end of Cade’s troubles – and now, more than ever, he must find the courage to defy his enemies, unite his friends, and unlock the secrets of descending.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n \u003cp\u003eDimensions:164 x 241  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Chris Riddell | Paul Stewart \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9780857535306 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Hardback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 528\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43688009203865,"sku":"11RC9780857535306","price":30.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/c880866c42af4ba3202948c16d69713c.jpg?v=1752150837"},{"product_id":"fire-in-the-sky","title":"Fire in the Sky","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhen the land comes to an end, Kallik, Toklo, Lusa and Ujurak venture on to the ice as a new path spreads out before them. But the ice is more dangerous than the bears expect, and all must put their trust in Kallik's paws as they struggle to survive the bitter cold. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:129 x 200  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Erin Hunter \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9781405254625 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Paperback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 332\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43691068752025,"sku":"11RD9781405254625","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/9a840f677315934ccedb79801cad2e0e.jpg?v=1752150834"},{"product_id":"fly-by-night","title":"Fly by Night","description":"\u003cp\u003eTwelve-year-old Mosca Mye hasn't got much. Her cruel uncle keeps her locked up in his mill, and her only friend is her pet goose, Saracen, who'll bite anything that crosses his path. But she does have one small, rare thing: the ability to read. She doesn't know it yet, but in a world where books are dangerous things, this gift will change her life. Enter Eponymous Clent, a smooth-talking con man who seems to love words nearly as much as Mosca herself. Soon Mosca and Clent are living a life of deceit and danger -- discovering secret societies, following shady characters onto floating coffeehouses, and entangling themselves with crazed dukes and double-crossing racketeers. It would be exactly the kind of tale Mosca has always longed to take part in, until she learns that her one true love -- words -- may be the death of her. \"Fly by Night\" is astonishingly original, a grand feat of the imagination from a masterful new storyteller. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:130 x 196  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Frances Hardinge \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9780330418263 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Trade Paperback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 448\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43691068817561,"sku":"11RD9780330418263","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/b346443a1ddddd7ce8595006ba689038.jpg?v=1752150833"},{"product_id":"seekers-great-bear-lake","title":"Seekers: Great Bear Lake","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe epic tale of three abandoned bear cubs on the journey of a lifetime. On the Longest Day they join hundreds of black, grizzly and polar bears at Great Bear Lake to ask for the help of the mystical bear-spirits